+Distant Horizons 3.2.0-b for Minecraft 1.21.1
+
+This project distributes the original, unmodified Distant Horizons jar as a
+NeoForge Jar-in-Jar dependency. Genesis calls its public terrain repository and
+event APIs; Distant Horizons remains a separate nested mod and is not shaded or
+renamed.
+
+Upstream source for this exact release:
+https://gitlab.com/distant-horizons-team/distant-horizons/-/tree/3.2.0b
+
+Project home:
+https://gitlab.com/distant-horizons-team/distant-horizons
+
+License notices are preserved alongside this file and inside the nested jar.
